      <p begin="00:03:15.956" end="00:03:19.762"><span begin="00:03:15.956" end="00:03:16.444">Hand</span> <span begin="00:03:16.444" end="00:03:16.669">in</span> <span begin="00:03:16.669" end="00:03:17.265">hand,</span> <span begin="00:03:17.265" end="00:03:17.728">the</span> <span begin="00:03:17.728" end="00:03:18.633">colors</span> <span begin="00:03:18.633" end="00:03:19.762">vibrant</span></p>
